---
const lessons = [
  {
    tag: 'Basics',
    title: 'What actually moves price',
    body: 'Liquidity, positioning, and narrative. The three forces behind every candle.'
  },
  {
    tag: 'Psychology',
    title: 'Why you exit too early',
    body: 'Loss aversion, anchoring, and the cost of watching every tick.'
  },
  {
    tag: 'Risk',
    title: 'The 1% rule, explained',
    body: 'Why sizing small keeps you in the game long enough to actually win.'
  },
  {
    tag: 'Basics',
    title: 'Reading a candle',
    body: 'Open, high, low, close. What each part tells you, and what it does not.'
  },
  {
    tag: 'Psychology',
    title: 'The revenge trade',
    body: 'The most expensive trade is the one you take to get back at the market.'
  },
  {
    tag: 'Risk',
    title: 'Drawdown, not win rate',
    body: 'You can win 9 out of 10 trades and still blow up. Here is why.'
  }
]
---

<section id="learn" class="soft">
  <div class="wrap">
    <h2 class="section-title">Learn</h2>
    <p class="section-sub">
      Plain-language breakdowns. No jargon walls, no shilling.
    </p>

    <div class="grid">
      {lessons.map((l) => (
        <article class="card">
          <span class="tag">{l.tag}</span>
          <h3>{l.title}</h3>
          <p>{l.body}</p>
        </article>
      ))}
    </div>

    <p class="soon">Full guides publishing soon. Start with the three above.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .soft {
    background: var(--bg-soft);
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border-soft);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-soft);
  }

  .grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr));
    gap: 20px;
  }

  .card {
    background: var(--bg-card);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    padding: 30px 26px;
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    transition: border-color 0.25s, transform 0.25s;
  }

  .card:hover {
    border-color: var(--gold);
    transform: translateY(-3px);
  }

  .tag {
    color: var(--gold);
    font-size: 12px;
    letter-spacing: 1.5px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    margin-bottom: 10px;
    display: block;
  }

  .card h3 {
    font-size: 17px;
    margin-bottom: 10px;
    letter-spacing: -0.3px;
    color: var(--text);
  }

  .card p {
    font-size: 13.5px;
    color: var(--text-mute);
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  .soon {
    margin-top: 36px;
    font-size: 13px;
    color: var(--text-dim);
  }
</style>
